<title>USA: Fairfield Communities stake cut by group.</title>
<headline>Fairfield Communities stake cut by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Physicians Insurance Co of Ohio said Tuesday it cuts its stake in Fairfield Communities Inc to 1,537,126 common shares or 15.45 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the sale of 195,000 common shares on October 18 at a price of $22.875 per share.</p>
</text>
